  {
    "id": 2017008030060,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "よくわかんないっすけど……\r\nいいことなんすよね？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、成長過程で起こることだし……\r\nでも、急激な変化に身体の方もびっくりするんじゃないかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030070,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "んー\r\nいいことなのに痛いって変っす",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030080,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あ、これ、お医者さんから預かったメモっす",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう、どれどれ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0100",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『しばらく様子を見て不安なら再受診、痛いときは休む、\r\n痛み止めも必要な時には飲んでいい』か……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030090,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "休めない仕事があるって言ったら、薬くれたっすよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\n今日は、痛みはどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030100,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "今日は痛くないっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030100"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1600
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030110,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……せっかく病院来たのに\r\nなんかもったいないっす",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、もったいないって……\r\n『いやなこと言われる』って心配してただろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "とりあえず、心配なさそうでよかった\r\n帰ろうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030120,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……ん",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030130,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "病気やケガじゃなかったのに、\r\n帰るっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっと……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あれ、いつもなら\r\nあっさりと帰りそうなのに……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030140,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "今日は痛くないのに、休むってなんか\r\nもったいない気がするっす",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あさひなりに、何かしないとっていう気持ちに\r\nなってくれてるのかな……）",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、何かしないともったいないな\r\nよし、足を使わずできることを考えよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えーっと、歌はレッスン場借りないとだし……\r\nそうだ、演技とか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030150,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんが教えてくれるっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺はプロじゃないから、あくまで提案なんだけど……\r\n役にもっとなりきるレッスンをしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030160,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "へぇ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030170,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "それでそれで？\r\n何するっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、例えば……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "家に帰ろう",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "事務所に帰ろう",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "洋館に行くのは\r\nどうだ？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030180,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "えっ？　家に帰るのがレッスンになるっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\nちょっと家事やってみたらどうかなって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら、今回の役って\r\nひとりで家中の家事を請け負うメイドだろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "集中してやってみたら、\r\nマーガレットの苦労とか楽しさがわかるような気がする",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030190,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あー洗濯とか料理とかっすか？\r\nお手伝いならやったことあるっすよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "家事はお手伝いより一歩先かな。経営みたいなものだ\r\n計画的に進行したり工夫して、効率よく回していく",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "マーガレットは家の家事、\r\nほとんどひとりで請け負って回しているんだから",
    "charAnim1": "surp4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030200,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "えーっと……\r\n急に言われてもわかんないっすよー",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、まずは何かひとつでも\r\n最初から最後まで責任持ってやってみたらどうかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "マーガレットみたいに実際やってみて、\r\n工夫したり失敗したり……きっと楽しいぞ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030210,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……そんなもんなんすかね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030210"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030220,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "これからっすか？\r\nなんでっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "why",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いただきものでクッキーがあるんだ\r\n途中で、缶入りの紅茶の葉も買って帰ろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030230,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "おやつっすか！　やったっす！\r\n……でも、紅茶よりジュースの方がいいっす",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ジュースも買ってもいいけど、\r\nあさひに紅茶を淹れてほしいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "せっかく紅茶の淹れ方も習ったんだし、\r\n復習も兼ねてさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひがマーガレットで、俺が主人のジル\r\n夕下がりのお茶会を、再現したらどうかなって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008030240,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "じゃあ、プロデューサーさん\r\nジルになりきるっすね？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700803/2017008030240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "むっ……！　そ、そうだな\r\n下手なりに、頑張ってみるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off",
